// Claude Code 1.3: Remote control policy (not Desktop policy or all cloud capabilities).
// Profile: L2 | NIST: AC-6, CM-6 | SOC 2: CC6.1
// https://howtoharden.com/guides/claude-code/#13-gate-remote-control-cloud-sessions-and-routines
